{"format":"nexus-update-v1","version":"2.1.3","notes":"No more 'pick a folder first': chats without a project folder now work in Documents\\Nexus Workspace automatically. You can still pick any folder per project or chat, or change the default in Settings > Projects & tools.","payload":"","signature":"ft+zg/lYYQM4wwPE3ksngvhCMP3YxtSkTjpRtfViGTiBbVvK7e4Vc1x7YAcReoNwDh7jLdkUKHE5c5Fhj8oDCg=="}